//MBKONLDN JOB (MBK,EOD,OPS),'ONLINE DOWN',
//             CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X
//*********************************************************************
//* JOB      : MBKONLDN                                               *
//* TITLE    : START OF BATCH WINDOW - CLOSE CICS FILES               *
//* SCHEDULE : CA-7 NETWORK MBKEOD - FIRST JOB, 23:30 DAILY           *
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------*
//* CLOSES THE UPDATEABLE CORE FILES IN CICSPRD1 SO THAT BATCH CAN    *
//* OPEN THEM FOR OUTPUT. WHILE CLOSED, CHANNEL REQUESTS GET          *
//* RC 0012 REASON FNOP ("NOT AVAILABLE - BATCH WINDOW") AND THE      *
//* IBANK CHANNEL SHOWS ITS MAINTENANCE PAGE FOR PAYMENTS.            *
//*                                                                   *
//* MBKOPCMD IS THE IN-HOUSE APF-AUTHORISED COMMAND UTILITY (SYSTEMS  *
//* PROGRAMMING LIBRARY SYS1.MBK.LINKLIB). IT ISSUES EACH COMMAND,    *
//* WAITS FOR THE CICS RESPONSE AND ENDS RC 8 IF ANY FILE FAILS TO    *
//* CLOSE (E.G. A LONG-RUNNING TASK STILL HOLDS IT).                  *
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------*
//* CICS FILES ACCTCIF AND THE ENQUIRY PATHS STAY OPEN (READ ONLY).   *
//* PSEOD010 OPENS THE BASE CLUSTER I-O WHILE CICS STILL READS IT VIA *
//* THE PATH - ACCEPTED (SHAREOPTIONS 2) - BALANCES SHOWN ONLINE      *
//* DURING THE WINDOW MAY BE PART-POSTED.                             *
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------*
//* 2010-03-08 AOS  2010 SUITE FILES (SOMAST, DDMAND, DDHOLD, CHGPEND,*
//*                 PRDPARM, ACCTNOC, CIFCTL) - BATCH OPENS THEM OLD  *
//* 2010-09-06 JNB  LOANMST / LOANCIF (LNDLY01)                       *
//* FXRATES IS NOT CLOSED - FXRAT01 RUNS IN THE ONLINE DAY (NSR).     *
//*********************************************************************
//CMD010   EXEC PGM=MBKOPCMD,PARM='WAIT=120'
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(ACCTMST) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(CIFMAST) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(MEMOLOG) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(PSTXREF) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(SOMAST) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(DDMAND) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(DDHOLD) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(CHGPEND) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(PRDPARM) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(LOANMST) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(LOANCIF) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(ACCTNOC) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(CIFCTL) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(SAVNTC) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(CHQSTOP) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(STMTADH) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(SWITCHES) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(SAVSWP) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(ALRTPRF) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET FILE(TAXCERT) CLOSED
F CICSPRD1,CEMT SET PROGRAM(PYINIT1) DISABLED
/*
